        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 84052RECUS4KNSCU, Two-Tone Gold Knurled Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Copper Knurled Cabinet Pull with Satin Brass Mounts features a textured grip that has been very popular ever since its Emtek release. The Knurled Cabinet Pull is at once eye-catching and modern. The Two-Tone Gold Knurled Cabinet Handle features a brilliant combination of satin brass and the brand new satin copper finish for something truly unique. The Emtek Gold Select Knurled Cabinet Pull is available in an array of sizes so you will be able to find something that works for your application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-REC-KN-specifications.gif?v=1704354609\" width=\"600\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Knurled Cabinet Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Knurled Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Stem Mount Finish: <b>Satin Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Bar Pull Finish: <b>Satin Copper</b></li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-84052-specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\"><b>Emtek Select Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 13 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-84052:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84053:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84054:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84055:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>EMT-84056:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84057:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84058:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84059:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84062:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>2 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84060:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84061:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84063:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84064:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>4 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 54-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
